{"html":"<header class=\"spec-title-strip\">\n<div class=\"spec-title-col\">\n<div class=\"spec-family-crumb\">\n            FAMILY 03 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">状态空间与 Mamba：长程传播、扫描偏置和 3D 代价</span><span class=\"lang-en\">State Space &amp; Mamba</span>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"spec-model-title\" id=\"model_019_segmamba-title\">SegMamba</h3>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-text lang-zh\">GSC + Tri-oriented Mamba 的 TSMamba block，以及 FUE 过滤的多尺度 skip。</p>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-en lang-en\">Combines Gated Spatial Convolution (GSC) with Tri-oriented Mamba (ToM) scans along axial, coronal, and sagittal axes plus Feature Uncertainty Estimation (FUE) skips.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-tensor-col\">\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">INPUT DOMAIN // 输入域</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">3D 医学体数据</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">3D volumetric medical scan (CT / MRI)</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">OUTPUT TARGET // 输出目标</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">多尺度融合的 3D 分割</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Multi-scale fused 3D volumetric segmentation</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</header><div class=\"model-full-body\">\n<!-- Main Split: Original Figure Plate (Left) + Forward Computation Graph (Right) -->\n<div class=\"spec-blueprint-grid\">\n<section class=\"spec-figure-plate\">\n<div class=\"plate-header\">\n<div class=\"plate-header-left\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">PRIMARY FIGURE // Figure 1 · PDF p.3</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">论文原始架构图</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Original Paper Architecture Diagram</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"plate-header-right\">\n<a class=\"plate-source-link\" href=\"https://doi.org/10.1007/978-3-031-72111-3_54\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>SOURCE PDF</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n<button class=\"plate-zoom-btn\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_019_segmamba')\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6M9 21H3v-6M21 3l-7 7M3 21l7-7\"></path></svg><span>FULLSCREEN LIGHTBOX</span></button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<figure class=\"arch-figure-box\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_019_segmamba')\" title=\"Click to open interactive pan &amp; zoom viewer\">\n<img alt=\"SegMamba original paper architecture figure, Figure 1\" class=\"arch-figure-img\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/83c2490043573d537b24.avif\"/>\n<figcaption class=\"plate-caption\">CLICK FIGURE TO OPEN INTERACTIVE PAN &amp; ZOOM VIEWER · Figure 1 · PDF p.3</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</section>\n<aside class=\"spec-circuit-panel\">\n<div class=\"circuit-header\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">COMPUTATION GRAPH // 9 STAGES</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">架构前向计算节点拆解</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Forward Pass Computation Nodes</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"circuit-controls\">\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_019_segmamba', -1)\" title=\"Previous Stage\" type=\"button\">◁</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn circuit-play-btn\" data-play-id=\"architecture_model_019_segmamba\" data-call-click=\"toggleAutoPlayNodes('architecture_model_019_segmamba')\" title=\"Auto-Trace Computation Graph\" type=\"button\">AUTO</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_019_segmamba', 1)\" title=\"Next Stage\" type=\"button\">▷</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"active-node-spotlight\" id=\"spotlight-architecture_model_019_segmamba\">\n<span class=\"spotlight-badge\">\n                STAGE 01 / 09 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">3D Input</span><span class=\"lang-en\">3D Input</span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text lang-zh\">C×D×H×W 体数据进入大核 depthwise stem。</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text spotlight-text-en lang-en\">Ingests 3d volumetric medical scan (ct / mri) and prepares initial tensor representations (3D Input).</span>\n</div>\n<ol class=\"circuit-timeline\">\n<li class=\"circuit-node active\" data-node-desc=\"C×D×H×W 体数据进入大核 depthwise stem。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Ingests 3d volumetric medical scan (ct / mri) and prepares initial tensor representations (3D Input).\" data-node-idx=\"0\" data-node-name=\"3D Input\" data-node-name-en=\"3D Input\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_019_segmamba', 0)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">01</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>3D Input</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">C×D×H×W 体数据进入大核 depthwise stem。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Ingests 3d volumetric medical scan (ct / mri) and prepares initial tensor representations (3D Input).</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"stride-2 大核逐通道卷积建立首级体特征。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Executes 7³ DW Stem to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.\" data-node-idx=\"1\" data-node-name=\"7³ DW Stem\" data-node-name-en=\"7³ DW Stem\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_019_segmamba', 1)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">02</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>7³ DW Stem</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">stride-2 大核逐通道卷积建立首级体特征。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Executes 7³ DW Stem to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"Gated Spatial Convolution 在序列化前补充局部三维空间关系。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs GSC within the core tri oriented 3d mamba unet computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"2\" data-node-name=\"GSC\" data-node-name-en=\"GSC\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_019_segmamba', 2)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">03</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>GSC</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">Gated Spatial Convolution 在序列化前补充局部三维空间关系。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs GSC within the core tri oriented 3d mamba unet computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"沿 D、H、W 三种取向执行 Mamba，融合各轴长程依赖。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Tri-oriented Mamba within the core tri oriented 3d mamba unet computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"3\" data-node-name=\"Tri-oriented Mamba\" data-node-name-en=\"Tri-oriented Mamba\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_019_segmamba', 3)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">04</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Tri-oriented Mamba</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">沿 D、H、W 三种取向执行 Mamba，融合各轴长程依赖。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Tri-oriented Mamba within the core tri oriented 3d mamba unet computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"GSC、LayerNorm、ToM、MLP 与两级 residual 组成主块。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs TSMamba Block within the core tri oriented 3d mamba unet computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"4\" data-node-name=\"TSMamba Block\" data-node-name-en=\"TSMamba Block\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_019_segmamba', 4)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">05</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>TSMamba Block</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">GSC、LayerNorm、ToM、MLP 与两级 residual 组成主块。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs TSMamba Block within the core tri oriented 3d mamba unet computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"下采样后重复 TSMamba，通道逐级增大。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs multi-scale Encoder within the core tri oriented 3d mamba unet computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"5\" data-node-name=\"多尺度 Encoder\" data-node-name-en=\"multi-scale Encoder\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_019_segmamba', 5)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">06</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">多尺度 Encoder</span><span class=\"lang-en\">multi-scale Encoder</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">下采样后重复 TSMamba，通道逐级增大。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs multi-scale Encoder within the core tri oriented 3d mamba unet computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"Feature-level Uncertainty Estimation 过滤和加权多尺度 skip 特征。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs FUE within the core tri oriented 3d mamba unet computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"6\" data-node-name=\"FUE\" data-node-name-en=\"FUE\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_019_segmamba', 6)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">07</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>FUE</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">Feature-level Uncertainty Estimation 过滤和加权多尺度 skip 特征。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs FUE within the core tri oriented 3d mamba unet computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"转置卷积上采样并融合经 FUE 筛选的 encoder 特征。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Applies Residual Decoder to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.\" data-node-idx=\"7\" data-node-name=\"Residual Decoder\" data-node-name-en=\"Residual Decoder\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_019_segmamba', 7)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">08</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Residual Decoder</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">转置卷积上采样并融合经 FUE 筛选的 encoder 特征。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Applies Residual Decoder to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"输出每体素类别概率。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Produces multi-scale fused 3d volumetric segmentation via Seg Head.\" data-node-idx=\"8\" data-node-name=\"Seg Head\" data-node-name-en=\"Seg Head\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_019_segmamba', 8)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">09</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Seg Head</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">输出每体素类别概率。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Produces multi-scale fused 3d volumetric segmentation via Seg Head.</span></div></li>\n</ol>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<!-- Mathematical Formalism Band -->\n<section aria-label=\"SegMamba Mathematical Formalism\" class=\"spec-math-band\">\n<div class=\"math-meta-col\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">MATHEMATICAL FORMALISM</span>\n<div class=\"math-title-text lang-zh\">核心公式 · SegMamba 沿深、高、宽三轴建模</div>\n<div class=\"math-title-en lang-en\">Core Formalism · Tri-Oriented 3D Volumetric Selective Scan (Depth / Height / Width)</div>\n</div>\n<div aria-label=\"SegMamba：核心公式 · SegMamba 沿深、高、宽三轴建模\" class=\"tex-formula-vector\" role=\"img\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" data-formula-index=\"19\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"9.295211pt\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" style=\"display:block;width:auto;max-width:100%;height:auto;max-height:96px;margin:0 auto\" version=\"1.1\" viewbox=\"-68.84248 -69.079189 387.230874 9.295211\" width=\"387.230874pt\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><defs><path d=\"M5.687764-2.782295C5.644291-3.970567 4.702368-4.73135 3.260502-4.73135H1.007133V-4.615421C1.528813-4.571948 1.651988-4.513984 1.659233-4.318353C1.659233-4.20967 1.630251-4.035777 1.586778-3.854638L.579645-.6521C.449225-.231858 