6\" xlink:href=\"#m019_g7-29\" y=\"-60.453338\"></use><use x=\"116.339535\" xlink:href=\"#m019_g10-45\" y=\"-61.947719\"></use><use x=\"123.208764\" xlink:href=\"#m019_g4-186\" y=\"-61.947719\"></use><use x=\"127.02444\" xlink:href=\"#m019_g10-150\" y=\"-61.947719\"></use><use x=\"131.783208\" xlink:href=\"#m019_g10-34\" y=\"-61.947719\"></use><use x=\"140.032275\" xlink:href=\"#m019_g7-44\" y=\"-60.453338\"></use><use x=\"148.613987\" xlink:href=\"#m019_g4-185\" y=\"-61.947719\"></use><use x=\"152.330047\" xlink:href=\"#m019_g14-83\" y=\"-61.947719\"></use><use x=\"157.869273\" xlink:href=\"#m019_g14-99\" y=\"-61.947719\"></use><use x=\"162.292688\" xlink:href=\"#m019_g14-97\" y=\"-61.947719\"></use><use x=\"166.716102\" xlink:href=\"#m019_g14-110\" y=\"-61.947719\"></use><use x=\"171.697422\" xlink:href=\"#m019_g7-44\" y=\"-60.453338\"></use><use x=\"180.328949\" xlink:href=\"#m019_g10-45\" y=\"-61.947719\"></use><use x=\"187.198178\" xlink:href=\"#m019_g4-186\" y=\"-61.947719\"></use><use x=\"191.013854\" xlink:href=\"#m019_g4-186\" y=\"-61.962663\"></use><use x=\"196.489859\" xlink:href=\"#m019_g10-150\" y=\"-61.947719\"></use><use x=\"221.074278\" xlink:href=\"#m019_g10-47\" y=\"-61.947719\"></use><use x=\"230.207728\" xlink:href=\"#m019_g1-61\" y=\"-61.947719\"></use><use x=\"239.859244\" xlink:href=\"#m019_g10-45\" y=\"-61.947719\"></use><use x=\"248.94234\" xlink:href=\"#m019_g4-184\" y=\"-61.947719\"></use><use x=\"257.492442\" xlink:href=\"#m019_g14-84\" y=\"-61.947719\"></use><use x=\"262.682969\" xlink:href=\"#m019_g14-111\" y=\"-61.947719\"></use><use x=\"267.664289\" xlink:href=\"#m019_g14-77\" y=\"-61.947719\"></use><use x=\"277.019209\" xlink:href=\"#m019_g4-185\" y=\"-61.947719\"></use><use x=\"280.73527\" xlink:href=\"#m019_g14-71\" y=\"-61.947719\"></use><use x=\"287.928297\" xlink:href=\"#m019_g14-83\" y=\"-61.947719\"></use><use x=\"293.467522\" xlink:href=\"#m019_g14-67\" y=\"-61.947719\"></use><use x=\"300.610735\" xlink:href=\"#m019_g4-185\" y=\"-61.947719\"></use><use x=\"304.874744\" xlink:href=\"#m019_g10-45\" y=\"-61.947719\"></use><use x=\"311.743974\" xlink:href=\"#m019_g4-186\" y=\"-61.947719\"></use><use x=\"315.559649\" xlink:href=\"#m019_g4-186\" y=\"-61.947719\"></use></g></svg>\n</div>\n</section>\n<!-- 5-Column Swiss Specification Matrix -->\n<div class=\"spec-evo-matrix\">\n<div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-bottleneck\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">01 // PRIOR LIMITATION</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">上一代瓶颈</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">高分辨率全体积 Transformer 的显存成本不可承受</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">High-resolution whole-volume 3D Transformers exceed GPU memory, while single-direction 3D flattening loses tri-planar anatomy.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-idea\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">02 // CORE HYPOTHESIS</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">核心想法</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">用多尺度 3D Mamba 处理 whole-volume 长序列依赖</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Apply gated 3D spatial convolutions followed by tri-directional Mamba scans across forward, reverse, and inter-slice axes.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-improvement\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">03 // ARCHITECTURAL DELTA</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">关键改进</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">线性 scan 覆盖中低分辨率 feature grid 上的数十万 token，并保留多尺度解码</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">TSMamba block (GSC + Tri-oriented Mamba) paired with uncertainty-weighted multi-scale skip refinement.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-adaptation\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">04 // MEDICAL TRANSLATION</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">医学适配</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">代表同行评议的 medical Mamba 3D 分割路线</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Representative peer-reviewed 3D medical Mamba architecture for brain tumor and colorectal segmentation.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-evidence\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">05 // EVIDENCE &amp; BOUNDARY</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">适用范围与证据</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">值得复现；仍缺统一配方、多中心和边界/小病灶证据</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Worth reproducing as a 3D SSM reference; still requires broader multi-center and boundary-level validation.</p></div>\n</div>\n<!-- 2-Column Design Principles & Medical Translation Band -->\n<div class=\"spec-dual-band\">\n<section class=\"spec-dual-col\">\n<div class=\"cell-kicker\">ARCHITECTURAL AXIOMS // 设计原理与数学机制</div>\n<ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">GSC 在 Mamba 展平前显式编码局部三维空间关系。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">Tri-oriented Mamba 分别沿深度、高度和宽度传播长程信息。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">FUE 对多尺度 skip 做不确定性筛选，避免无条件复用所有 encoder 特征。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Core Hypothesis: Apply gated 3D spatial convolutions followed by tri-directional Mamba scans across forward, reverse, and inter-slice axes.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Architectural Delta: TSMamba block (GSC + Tri-oriented Mamba) paired with uncertainty-weighted multi-scale skip refinement.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Mathematical Formalism: Tri-Oriented 3D Volumetric Selective Scan (Depth / Height / Width).</li></ul>\n</section>\n<section class=\"spec-dual-col\">\n<div class=\"cell-kicker\">CLINICAL TRANSLATION &amp; BOUNDARIES // 医学应用与安全边界</div>\n<ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">适合 whole-volume 长关系与多尺度分割并重的 3D 研究。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">三轴 scan、FUE 和卷积 stem 都是性能来源，消融不能只比较 Mamba 有无。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Clinical Translation: Representative peer-reviewed 3D medical Mamba architecture for brain tumor and colorectal segmentation.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Evidence &amp; Safety Boundary: Worth reproducing as a 3D SSM reference; still requires broader multi-center and boundary-level validation.</li></ul>\n</section>\n</div>\n<!-- Provenance Footer Bar -->\n<footer class=\"spec-footer-bar\">\n<div class=\"spec-footer-cell\">\n<span class=\"footer-kicker\">PRIMARY LITERATURE // 原始文献</span>\n<a class=\"spec-ext-link\" href=\"https://doi.org/10.1007/978-3-031-72111-3_54\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n<span>SegMamba: Long-range Sequential Modeling Mamba For 3D Medical Image Segmentation</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg>\n</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-footer-cell\">\n<span class=\"footer-kicker\">OFFICIAL IMPLEMENTATION // 开源代码</span>\n<a class=\"spec-ext-link\" href=\"https://github.com/ge-xing/SegMamba\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>作者/机构官方实现</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n</div>\n</footer>\n</div>"}
